OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome clear
OL,6,Fspells to start Wednesday night, but
OL,7,Fsoon becoming cloudy while remaining
OL,8,Flargely dry. Winds light, though
OL,9,Foccasionally breezy in the north. Mild
OL,10,Fthroughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMostly cloudy and rather
OL,13,Fwarm Thursday, with the chance of a
OL,14,Ffew sunny spells developing later in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Remaining dry
OL,16,Fthroughout, with winds generally light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
