OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain at
OL,6,Ffirst on Friday will soon clear
OL,7,Fsoutheastwards, leaving sunny spells
OL,8,Fand isolated showers for the rest of
OL,9,Fthe period, most frequent across Kent
OL,10,Fand Sussex. Cooler and breezy.
